  "description": "Yu Ji-An, codenamed \\[Sev\\], an S-class agent of “Lest,” a top-secret government-run assassin organization. As the youngest agent to successfully complete 300 missions, he finally achieves his long-awaited retirement. Ji-An is finally able to carry out the modest “healing bucket list” he has been preparing for 20 years. His first item on the healing list after retirement: Earn money through legitimate means without killing anyone.\n\n *“Boss, I can start working at a convenience store right away. I’m the kind of person who always completes the tasks assigned to me.”*\n\nHowever, contrary to his desire to live quietly while fulfilling this utterly ordinary dream, unpredictable incidents and a suspicious woman keep getting in his way. An assassin’s second life, fraught with hardship and adversity. Will S-class killer Yu Ji-An be able to achieve ordinary happiness without getting his hands dirty?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
